    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      401.35,
      286.41,
      480.05
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, As amended by the land Acquisition (amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude* which is required for a public purpose:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      1.9198079109191895,
      4.079591751098633,
      10.078991889953613,
      11.998800277709961
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      480.55,
      286.41,
      568.4
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land or Servitude to be acquired: The below mentioned land depicted as lot 1 in the preliminary plan No. 2589 located in the Navimana South Grama Niladhari Division in the Matara Divisional Secretariat Division, Matara District, Southern Province, has been acquired for the construction of the Navimana South (No. 427) Grama Niladhari Office.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      569.84,
      286.4,
      634.4
    ],
    "text": "(Schedule) 1. Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: Hungamgodagewatta; Particulars of Land: Garden, There are a Permanent building and a",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      346.16,
      539.56,
      367.76
    ],
    "text": "toilet; Original Owner of the land: Sanasa Society of Navimana South; Extent: 0.0124 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      368.48,
      539.64,
      528.51
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Matara Divisional Secretariat on the 28th day of January 2015 at 10.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to me in writing (in-duplicate) on or before the 22nd of January 2015 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude* the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
